WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.189
Week 36: Integrated Field Capstone. manage an unfamiliar situation brief and persuade reflect on strengths and a maintenance plan

2
00:00:09.189 --> 00:00:38.444
Read for the situation. Al terminar el curso, la meta no es saber cada palabra. La meta es comprender, actuar, reparar errores y seguir aprendiendo. La competencia se mantiene con contacto frecuente y tareas cada vez más exigentes. At the end of the course, the goal is not to know every word. The goal is to understand, act, repair errors, and keep learning. Proficiency is maintained through frequent contact and increasingly demanding tasks.

3
00:00:38.444 --> 00:00:47.185
Read again for evidence. Identify who acts, what changes, when it happens, and which words establish the relationship between events.

4
00:00:47.185 --> 00:00:54.496
Reading activities. Reading activity 86; Reading activity 87; Reading activity 88

5
00:00:54.496 --> 00:01:02.405
Retell. Without looking back, give the main idea, three supporting details, and one reasonable inference in Spanish.

6
00:01:02.405 --> 00:01:40.844
Model language. Permítame aclarar lo que entendí. — Allow me to clarify what I understood. Antes de actuar, debemos comprobar la fuente. — Before acting, we must verify the source. Puedo resumir las dos posturas y justificar mi recomendación. — I can summarize both positions and justify my recommendation. Me adapto al registro sin imitar un acento. — I adapt to the register without imitating an accent. Mi plan de mantenimiento combina lectura, escucha, conversación y escritura. — My maintenance plan combines reading, listening, conversation, and writing.

7
00:01:40.844 --> 00:01:50.763
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
